      "content": "makes sense. i guess i'll start on the lower side. i've also noticed some weird little holes in the leaves and just generally feel like things aren't \"right\" in the soil even though the numbers look okay. is there anything else at the microscopic level that could be eating my nitrogen or just generally messing with the nutrient cycle?",
